### 3. Functional Requirements
 
#### 3.1 Authentication & User Management
- **FR-AUTH-01 (Signup)**: Enable customers to register with First Name, Last Name, Email, Password, and AI procurement preferences/interests (e.g., *Mobiles, Gaming Laptops, Audio*).
- **FR-AUTH-02 (Password Security)**: Enforce strong credentials (minimum 8 characters, uppercase, lowercase, numeric, and special character) hashed using PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 with cryptographically secure salts.
- **FR-AUTH-03 (Login & Session)**: Authenticate registered credentials, validate against database records, and issue session contexts storing user profiles and shopping history.
- **FR-AUTH-04 (Role-Based Access Control)**: Enforce role separation (`Customer`, `Admin`) across endpoints.
 
#### 3.2 E-Commerce Storefront
- **FR-ECOMM-01 (Catalog Browsing & Search)**: Categorized browsing (Mobiles, Laptops, Accessories) with real-time keyword search, stock levels, and pricing.
- **FR-ECOMM-02 (Product Details)**: Comprehensive product views detailing technical specifications, warranty, availability, and pros/cons.
- **FR-ECOMM-03 (Cart Management)**: Add items with custom quantities, update quantities, delete line items, calculate real-time taxes/shipping, and clear carts.
- **FR-ECOMM-04 (Order Placement)**: Atomic transaction converting active cart items into persistent `Orders` and `OrderItems` records, decrementing inventory, and resetting active carts.
- **FR-ECOMM-05 (Order Tracking)**: Track live dispatch milestones (Placed, Processing, Dispatched, Shipped, Delivered) with estimated delivery dates.
- **FR-ECOMM-06 (Order Cancellation)**: Self-service order cancellation for eligible statuses (`PLACED`, `PROCESSING`), updating persistent state to `CANCELLED`.
- **FR-ECOMM-07 (Reorder)**: Re-add all items from any previously placed order directly into the active cart.
 
#### 3.3 AI Shopping Agent
- **FR-AI-01 (Product Search & Filtering)**: Natural language queries with price ceilings (e.g., *"Show mobiles under ₹30,000"*).
- **FR-AI-02 (Recommendations with Reasoning)**: Curated device recommendations with explicit *"Why?"* rationale based on customer workloads.
- **FR-AI-03 (Product Comparison ⭐)**: Dynamic side-by-side feature comparison between any two catalog items (e.g., *Samsung M35 vs OnePlus Nord CE*), detailing display, battery, camera, and concluding with a recommended pick.
- **FR-AI-04 (Cart Mutation Actions)**: Add items to cart (*"Add Samsung M35 to cart"*), adjust quantities (*"Increase Samsung quantity to 3"*), remove items (*"Delete Acer from cart"*), and calculate cart total (*"How much will I pay?"*).
- **FR-AI-05 (Autonomous Checkout)**: Check out and generate orders directly via natural language (*"Checkout"*, *"Place order"*).
- **FR-AI-06 (Order Operations)**: Track orders (*"Where is my order?"*) and cancel orders (*"Cancel order #1009"*).
- **FR-AI-07 (Smart Budget Advisor ⭐)**: Recommend the best product fitting a budget limit (e.g., *"I have ₹25,000. Which phone is best?"*).
- **FR-AI-08 (Out-of-Stock Alternatives)**: Propose in-stock substitutes when a requested brand/model is unavailable (e.g., *iPhone 16* -> *Samsung S24 / OnePlus Nord CE*).
- **FR-AI-09 (Complete Setup Concierge ⭐)**: Assemble a multi-item package matching budget constraints (e.g., *"Build a complete setup under ₹60,000"* -> Laptop + Earbuds + Watch) with a one-click *"Add Setup to Cart"* CTA.
- **FR-AI-10 (Voice Shopping 🎙️)**: Native speech recognition transcribing verbal instructions to text commands.
- **FR-AI-11 (Personalized Suggestions)**: Contextual onboarding and hardware suggestions derived from user profile interest tags and order history.
 
