### 12. Authentication Flow
 
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant AngularApp as Angular Client (Login)
    participant AuthRouter as FastAPI /auth/login
    participant DB as SQL Server (Users)
 
    Customer->>AngularApp: Inputs Email & Password
    AngularApp->>AuthRouter: POST /auth/login {email, password}
    AuthRouter->>DB: SELECT * FROM Users WHERE Email = :email
    alt User Not Found
        DB-->>AuthRouter: NULL
        AuthRouter-->>AngularApp: 401 Unauthorized ("Invalid email or password")
        AngularApp-->>Customer: Display Error Alert
    else User Exists
        DB-->>AuthRouter: User Record (Salt, Key Hash)
        AuthRouter->>AuthRouter: PBKDF2_HMAC_SHA256(password, salt, 100000)
        alt Computed Key == Stored Key
            AuthRouter-->>AngularApp: 200 OK (User Profile, Role, Interests)
            AngularApp->>AngularApp: Store User Context in Signal & LocalStorage
            AngularApp-->>Customer: Redirect to Dashboard / Products
        else Password Invalid
            AuthRouter-->>AngularApp: 401 Unauthorized
            AngularApp-->>Customer: Display Error Alert
        end
    end
```
 
